600 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895900/extras/b939cc4a63278c2dfe57dfac18f0701f.webm?t=1771595678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895900/extras/b939cc4a63278c2dfe57dfac18f0701f.mp4?t=1771595678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From medieval villages to castles and the beautiful grassy mountainside of the Appennino to the remnants of classical Rome, explore a magnificent 14th-century Italy through the eyes of a knight-errant. Search your surroundings to stumble upon trinkets &amp; treasures to complete your collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895900/extras/090adf73315363e39060113390323afd.poster.avif?t=1771595678\" width=600 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895900/extras/090adf73315363e39060113390323afd.webm?t=1771595678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895900/extras/090adf73315363e39060113390323afd.mp4?t=1771595678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cBianca, you are all that is left to me\u2026 I shall save you. This, I vow.\u201d</p>","developers":["Sedleo"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1895900/e2406ff9c7687c9a2a4775092208d8691b04738b/header.jpg?t=1771595678","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Dear Villagers. Developed by Sedleo, Dear Villagers is a trademark of Plug In Digital LTD, All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av